# Multi-tenant: list of IMAP accounts to monitor.
# `user` is the natural account key — used both for login and DB tagging.
# Use an APP password, not the account password.
# Yandex: https://id.yandex.ru/security/app-passwords
#
# Defaults: host=imap.yandex.ru, port=993 — omit both if Yandex.
# `user` and `password` are required.
#
# IMPORTANT: this must be ONE line. dotenv has no multiline values, and
# pydantic-settings fails at startup on a pretty-printed JSON array.
ACCOUNTS=[{"user":"box1@yandex.ru","password":"app-password-1"},{"user":"box2@yandex.ru","password":"app-password-2"}]
